      "content": "TL 10 NW                    ST MICHAEL           POTTERSCROUCH LANE                                                  (north west side)                                                  POTTERS CROUCH 9/295                                            Windridge Farmhouse GV                                               II Farmhouse.  Late C17 block, altered and extended in T-plan early- mid C19 and C20.  Timber frame early part.  Stuccoed brick walls. Plain tile hipped roof 2 storeys.  The E block has a large late- C17 external chimney stack on the N wall, the upper part red brick with an ovolo cornice.   The S side of this range has 2 recessed 8/8 sash windows, segmental-headed on ground floor. Doorcase on left with half-glazed reeded-panel door, panelled reveals, reeded pilasters, shaped brackets, flat hood and scroll- patterned fan.   End elevation with triple-hung sash.   Wide bracketed eaves.  W block has mostly C20 casements.  C20 stacks. Listing NGR: TL1242905758"
    }
  ],
